<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices weaker, ammonia higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices weaker, ammonia higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were weaker on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is just no demand at all,&quot; one dealer commented.</p>
<p>Ammonia prices were stronger, however, boosted by demand from the industrial sector.</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   173-175			dn 5</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     180-184			dn 2-1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   225-230			up 10-5</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
